DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ability to boot a machine over the network is useful for _d_i_s_k_l_e_s_s or
     _d_a_t_a_l_e_s_s machines, or as a temporary measure while repairing or re-in‐
     stalling file systems on a local disk.  This file provides a general de‐
     scription of the interactions between a client and its server when a
